        <mxCell id="RXtlOFpf3LFGIGF0yc4--22" value="&lt;b&gt;on&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;create&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;br&gt;- extract raw content into text&lt;br&gt;- ingestion pipeline for chunking e.g.&lt;br&gt;- embed content and store in VDB&lt;br&gt;- create File object and store file on disk" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#005700;fillColor=#008a00;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" vertex="1">
