          <mxGeometry x="460" y="570" width="120" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="RXtlOFpf3LFGIGF0yc4--47" value="Example Workflow:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. User opens a new chat -&amp;gt; create a new &lt;i&gt;Conversation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. User writes the question &quot;What is syntinels?&quot; -&amp;gt; Create a new &lt;i&gt;Message&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Build index from QueryEngine (which uses VDB)&lt;br&gt;4. Build a history of conversation using the model method (e.g.)&lt;br&gt;5. Build&amp;nbsp;ReactAgent for Chat with&amp;nbsp;ReActChatFormatter and a list of ChatMessages as history&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;using QueryEngine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;5. Query ReactAgent with a message (which is embedded using its already defined service context)&lt;br&gt;6. Store response as Message for Conversation&lt;br&gt;7. Return conversation to the user&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Chat low level:&lt;br&gt;https://docs.llamaindex.ai/en/stable/module_guides/deploying/chat_engines/usage_pattern.html#low-level-composition-api&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Things to consider: Asynchronous generation (and retry in frontend until result appears)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#008a00;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#005700;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="640" y="280" width="360" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="RXtlOFpf3LFGIGF0yc4--48" value="Data Ingestion Workflow:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. User requests a new website via API&lt;br&gt;2. Backend creates a Document object (database)&lt;br&gt;3. Scrape website and extract text using a LlamaIndexLoader -&amp;gt; Document (LlamaIndex)&lt;br&gt;4. Create data ingestion pipeline using e.g. Chunker and TitleExtractor -&amp;gt; List of Nodes&lt;br&gt;5. Enrich metadata of nodes with user_id and document_id&lt;br&gt;6. Store nodes in VDB (can be probably done in Pipeline)&lt;br&gt;7. Update Document (database) model&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thinks to consider: Data deletion workflow for removing documents and nodes" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#008a00;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#005700;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="510" y="-240" width="360" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="RXtlOFpf3LFGIGF0yc4--49" value="Data Retrieval Workflow:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Input is user_id&lt;br&gt;....&lt;br&gt;2. Output is index object limited to nodes having the same user_id&lt;br&gt;3. index object is prepared for ChatEngine&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Multi Tenancy Guide:&lt;br&gt;https://docs.llamaindex.ai/en/stable/examples/multi_tenancy/multi_tenancy_rag.html" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#008a00;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#005700;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="750" y="20" width="350" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
